<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 01:55:47 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>狂欢观看和狂欢购物结合在一起：亚马逊让 Prime 观众购买角色穿着和使用的东西，或者下一个最接近的东西</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/binge-watching-shopping-amazon-shop-the-scene-feature-jeff-bezos-streaming-tech/</link><description>亚马逊的新 Prime Video 功能使用人工智能来帮助观众购买与他们在屏幕上看到的产品相似的产品。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1415078072-e1789160608805.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 21:15:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/binge-watching-shopping-amazon-shop-the-scene-feature-jeff-bezos-streaming-tech/</guid></item><item><title>伊丽莎白·霍姆斯 (Elizabeth Holmes) 的手写便条充分说明了她认为自己必须以首席执行官的身份展现自己</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/elizabeth-holmes-handwritten-note-present-herself-as-ceo/</link><description>她的笔记包括“我只关心生意”、“我不会做出反应”和“我不冲动”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Untitled-design-6.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 15:23:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/elizabeth-holmes-handwritten-note-present-herself-as-ceo/</guid></item><item><title>一位前人类研究人员声称人工智能可能会在 2030 年杀死我们所有人。但他未能回答最根本的问题：我们应该对此做什么？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/ex-anthropic-researcher-jacob-coxon-ai-could-end-humanity-fails-to-answer-most-essential-question/</link><description>一位人工智能研究人员发布的一篇帖子在网上疯传，警告该技术所带来的生存威胁，敲响了警钟。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2276546969-e1789071809610.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 20:24:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/ex-anthropic-researcher-jacob-coxon-ai-could-end-humanity-fails-to-answer-most-essential-question/</guid></item><item><title>霍尔木兹外交迹象导致油价暴跌，而沙特阿拉伯则在与威胁原油另一个瓶颈的伊朗盟友的斗争中陷入困境</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/oil-prices-hormuz-diplomacy-saudi-arabia-houthis-pakistan-us-bab-al-mandab/</link><description>由沙特阿拉伯、阿联酋、卡塔尔、科威特、巴林和阿曼组成的海湾合作委员会的外交部长将于周一会见伊朗外长。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2293189033-e1789136555963.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 19:07:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/oil-prices-hormuz-diplomacy-saudi-arabia-houthis-pakistan-us-bab-al-mandab/</guid></item><item><title>凯西悄然成为美国第五大披萨连锁店。认识财富 500 强加油站 Z 世代无法停止发帖</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/caseys-gas-station-pizza-chain-fortune-500-gen-z-texas/</link><description>您是否听说过美国第五大披萨连锁店，以其红色屋顶、玉米卷披萨、香肠肉汁底料、早餐片而闻名？ &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/caseys-e1788006519213.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:37:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/caseys-gas-station-pizza-chain-fortune-500-gen-z-texas/</guid></item><item><title>霍华德·卢特尼克、拉里·西尔弗斯坦、吉姆·皮尔斯和米特·罗姆尼都在最后一刻改变了计划，导致他们无法在 9/11 进入世贸中心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/howard-lutnick-larry-silverstein-jim-pierce-mitt-romney-9-11-twin-towers-terrorist-attacks/</link><description>学校办学、医生拜访、国会的预算斗争。那天早上，计划的微小变化导致数十人离开世贸中心。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294160589-e1789148057708.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 18:09:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/howard-lutnick-larry-silverstein-jim-pierce-mitt-romney-9-11-twin-towers-terrorist-attacks/</guid></item><item><title>微软公关主管 Frank Shaw 在塑造这家软件巨头的公共信息近 30 年后离职</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/microsoft-head-of-communications-frank-shaw-leaving-after-nearly-30-years-of-shaping-the-software-giants-public-messaging/</link><description>肖与微软的三位首席执行官——比尔·盖茨、史蒂夫·鲍尔默和萨蒂亚·纳德拉——共事，并在塑造微软与外界沟通的方式方面发挥了重要作用。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1246871366-e1789148208931.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 17:49:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/microsoft-head-of-communications-frank-shaw-leaving-after-nearly-30-years-of-shaping-the-software-giants-public-messaging/</guid></item><item><title>随着沙特限制财政支出，沙特胡曼转向外部投资</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/saudis-humain-turns-to-outside-investment-as-the-kingdom-reins-in-fiscal-spending/</link><description>Humain 正在筹备 IPO 和数十亿美元的新资本，以增强其数据中心建设和更广泛的人工智能雄心。但对项目进行排序和保护客户可能是一个挑战。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Humain--e1788946741871.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 09:55:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/09/saudis-humain-turns-to-outside-investment-as-the-kingdom-reins-in-fiscal-spending/</guid></item><item><title>Aflac 总裁：为什么人工智能不应该推动您的医疗保健</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/aflac-president-why-ai-shouldnt-drive-your-healthcare/</link><description>在 Z 世代成年人中，76% 的人在看医生之前转向人工智能。在千禧一代中，这一比例为 63%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/virgil-miller.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/10/aflac-president-why-ai-shouldnt-drive-your-healthcare/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 已暂停其 200 美元的 ChatGPT 注册，因为对新型号 Astra 的“前所未有”的需求对其系统造成了压力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/openai-astra-chatgpt-pro-pause/</link><description>即使自 2023 年以来可用计算量扩大了 9.5 倍，OpenAI 仍在暂停新的 Pro 20X 帐户，同时增加更多容量&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292626650-e1789147251662.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 16:57:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/11/openai-astra-chatgpt-pro-pause/</guid></item></channel></rss>